1
00:00:06,881 --> 00:00:07,656
I'm going to

2
00:00:07,657 --> 00:00:08,550
the club retreat tomorrow.

3
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,509
Just so you know.

4
00:00:09,509 --> 00:00:10,161
Can't get in touch

5
00:00:10,162 --> 00:00:11,162
with Han Se-woon?

6
00:00:13,221 --> 00:00:14,305
I guess he's probably busy.

7
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:18,361
How did you know

8
00:00:18,362 --> 00:00:19,402
I was texting Han Se-woon?

9
00:00:20,937 --> 00:00:21,854
I'm quicker at picking up on

10
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:23,148
things than I am at running.

11
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,359
I suppose you are.

12
00:00:29,404 --> 00:00:30,200
You got hurt during

13
00:00:30,201 --> 00:00:31,201
